1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,700
Raat gyarah baje.

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:03,130
Sheher so gaya...

3
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:05,030
lekin ek talwar abhi

4
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:06,201
bhi jaag rahi hai.

5
00:00:06,241 --> 00:00:07,811
Ye uski kahani hai,

6
00:00:07,931 --> 00:00:09,891
jisne apna naam bhula diya...

7
00:00:10,291 --> 00:00:12,006
sirf ek vaada yaad hai.

8
00:00:12,046 --> 00:00:13,456
Wo akela kyun?

9
00:00:13,586 --> 00:00:15,351
Kyunki teen aaye the use dhundhne.

10
00:00:15,391 --> 00:00:17,701
Unki aankhon mein laal roshni thi...

11
00:00:17,901 --> 00:00:20,155
aur uske haath mein ek imtihaan.

12
00:00:20,195 --> 00:00:21,105
Ek pal.

13
00:00:21,525 --> 00:00:22,385
Ek vaar.

14
00:00:22,945 --> 00:00:24,718
Baarish ki boondein ruk gayi.

15
00:00:24,758 --> 00:00:26,558
Sab kuch dhundh mein tha.

16
00:00:26,858 --> 00:00:27,548
Faisla...

17
00:00:27,798 --> 00:00:28,515
aaj raat.

18
00:00:28,555 --> 00:00:29,405
Chhat par,

19
00:00:29,485 --> 00:00:30,675
chaand ke saamne.

20
00:00:30,945 --> 00:00:31,895
Usne kaha...

21
00:00:31,975 --> 00:00:33,688
aaj koi nahi bachega.

22
00:00:33,728 --> 00:00:34,698
Aakhri vaar.

23
00:00:35,058 --> 00:00:35,988
Poori taakat.

24
00:00:36,418 --> 00:00:37,158
Aur phir...

25
00:00:37,578 --> 00:00:38,682
sab shaant.

26
00:00:38,722 --> 00:00:39,742
Subah hui.

27
00:00:39,862 --> 00:00:40,852
Wo chala gaya...

28
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:42,142
kahani reh gayi.

29
00:00:42,422 --> 00:00:43,442
Part 2 chahiye?

30
00:00:43,562 --> 00:00:44,407
Comment karo.
